      "title": "Talk the case through before voting again",
      "rationale": "Juror 8 alone votes not guilty. OPTIONS: A, vote again at once. B, talk it through for an hour, then vote. WHY B: a boy's life is at stake, and eleven people reached their vote in five minutes.",
