    {
      "id": "decision-7cc2149a-724b-43f1-a6d1-b65ad4eace86",
      "title": "Re-enact the old man's walk to his door",
      "rationale": "The old man said he got from his bed to the door in 15 seconds, with a stroke behind him. OPTIONS: A, take his word for it. B, pace it out in the jury room and time it. WHY B: the timing is checkable, so check it.",
