    {
      "id": "decision-118b93aa-1cac-4dbf-a1bb-b332baf62e02",
      "title": "Find the defendant not guilty",
      "rationale": "QUESTION: is the defendant guilty of murder? The final vote is 12 to 0 for not guilty. WHY: the knife is not unique, the old man could not have reached the door in time, and the woman across the tracks was not wearing her glasses. Neither witness holds up, so there is reasonable doubt.",
